1
00:00:00,331 --> 00:00:01,661
[WHISPERS INDISTINCTLY]

2
00:00:01,832 --> 00:00:03,832
[CHUCKLES]

3
00:00:04,001 --> 00:00:06,671
(Penny:)- What?
- Uh, he said maybe we should enter you...

4
00:00:06,837 --> 00:00:08,337
...in the killer-robot competition.

5
00:00:08,505 --> 00:00:09,545
[RAJESH CHUCKLING]

6
00:00:15,262 --> 00:00:17,262
[PHONE RINGING]

7
00:00:24,646 --> 00:00:28,276
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard, the phone is ringing!

8
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:33,449
Here's a crazy idea, Ma: answer it!

9
00:00:34,156 --> 00:00:35,616
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Hello?

10
00:00:35,783 --> 00:00:37,243
(Howard's Mother(voice):)All right, hold on.

11
00:00:37,409 --> 00:00:39,159
(Howard's Mother(voice):)It's your friend, Leonard!

12
00:00:39,328 --> 00:00:43,458
(Howard's Mother(voice):)He wants to know
why you're not at school today.

13
00:00:44,041 --> 00:00:45,921
(Howard:)I don't go to school, Ma.

14
00:00:46,085 --> 00:00:48,835
(Howard:)I work at a university.

15
00:00:49,004 --> 00:00:52,094
MRS. WOLOWITZ: That's a school.
Now pick up the phone.

16
00:00:52,257 --> 00:00:53,927
I don't wanna talk to anybody.

17
00:00:54,093 --> 00:00:57,723
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Should I ask Leonard
to bring over your homework?

18
00:00:58,639 --> 00:01:00,179
(Howard:)I don't have homework.

